      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "faf640bbef2c7c0c62316616adf6bf7caf03ced7dbc7087aea6dd66b7af7e855",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0c4332cfd9dbc80beeaff1e9d352ce4f6e01da9c440b9b0c91c8f87c6e8d8d7",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "19ba42c1a60a425d98316bbfb6a1f565dd7c1a417d51339f9df0022da92c620c",
      "text": "Harness",
      "hash": "e3b5b45953d79a150092df37922ee6261a81040f5fb3c084fa00efffe8b98589"
    },
    {
      "id": "dabfc5eec6add9eac8e74992bcd60bb850da311a27a4e0f555a6a91a4ef7146d",
      "text": "Everything around the model that turns it into an agent: tools, system prompt, context-window management, permissions, hooks.",
      "hash": "e40299472c9a9bb26d0674f0080cba6484a9e46266325376cc8a4c4b67354586"
    },
    {
      "id": "64fe759cb737cd7775b19a1024c56ea0ba0193e90871c37b4bcd96631e9f9ac1",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "183fab1508a503e1f6ac6cb47881e75b4e4782ff7b693635902be32018678af2",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec718bc16966327e3b4895c0164b1b5efbbddc715b5c9ae727a8c8418b02cdbe",
      "text": "Everything around the",
      "hash": "0f7fa8dd7f7e1d6e2ab80c14c1ad2568c6932dd7788f7dd545ebdfe5657c8aee"
    },
    {
      "id": "8402bb08bc0778d8fab86230a034f966fc03a0ea907261d893bd401c12d4be6e",
      "text": "that turns it into an",
      "hash": "d306748e23b29f8ddec45a9d612915fd3483a6c1be3c606c5c5fcd5e404b5b07"
    },
    {
      "id": "edb2727c238ed5856c0d90f0e1989636112c1b55792e7232cc57daa042c243c9",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e83f53dd9d22163b28054685e4580f78e4dcfdf3b62eaa5c4caf7ccc8a7942d",
      "text": "context-window management",
      "hash": "348a8dec0cb24b229c2f8f452ecf21a0789c9d06418dcbf1ff40903fc74b28c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a02fa80b66ffb46487cc319d1df87756babbdcc837936fe88e14e48d0ce9c7",
      "text": ", permissions, hooks.",
      "hash": "e8c357e883573783dc8bb6a3c606dfc56da2a7fde2884dd9aadcbd7b471018ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "89f3bf2a47ff07dc1e4362468dafd365d76ea64a2d17ef372b68b4907f2e61be",
      "text": "Claude.ai",
      "hash": "bb601f44e963c80622b7df3ef902e8fbdcc67eb709ea22cf9a7845c662594417"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7bd6f296a7c812df87fafab3d4739614ec750c87e27e619ac5ae859d4e30056",
      "text": "Claude Code",
      "hash": "246ef8c1130d56f5d9df740a4b26c033a8b9c064daba9bb0a052d18993e87373"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e0e5c81749ea4828c20d5ea222c6ef35a24a299bcb18927646ef6a16c436769",
      "text": "run on the same model but behave differently because their harnesses differ.",
      "hash": "5864d44f90bee0349c2c6d3c32d55f162fc1f85d7509e44005ef32344e5be3d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "3268ef6adcdb56e68fc20feb7c862bd8b10db67b03ed26f088348ba0ef2b424f",
      "text": "The model itself only does one thing: take text in, produce text out. It can't read a file, run a command, or remember the last",
      "hash": "8313152d4ba7bb301b78b3d69077084f5b588f15293fbfc6c47582edbbd9bee2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c12fb2f5c6cf71ee141942097b636e3b3b1f77caceadc173a1f4642079e812f3",
      "text": ". The harness supplies all of that. It assembles the",
      "hash": "9f320b6ba462aa72a9ee6e1c120494ca1497fba7bb47075f40f60be29b0c86e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "42d8682409b2e10e5ae5b93f4ceba317f0c2445ba1cc0e5c49e4099f9a59b68d",
      "text": "for each",
      "hash": "0e591f12d69f6d284b18d9aa1470781ee37fcc4d6118725599b96b1c5ccea390"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4ff85f3237f8206cda4062777d29d6aeff427972670092e1fb3fd49ce4fe518",
      "text": "model provider request",
      "hash": "3004d539f1f0ae7a40070d95ba4a1323d874684827edf4d55b29a1056f8da7a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc8a0497e5bd019253c845abe7267e548e89445a6e828879d70e4f911b5aeeab",
      "text": ", executes the",
      "hash": "5a0a80d226335a22cbc84956a514ec9e35d229e93ad9560cd5a9e25aa0896dbc"
    },
    {
      "id": "73fdc171874879cfa1f48c8e544d8ad6f27f809ba74946855663f1382836e193",
      "text": "tool calls",
      "hash": "b102cdc6032df9ca67169a6d620fba86a9b0344b8dab71565a5b230deadb5e68"
    },
    {
      "id": "08933657640f85974e773aafb2cc5a139d6095c604afd2fcfa73a540c82fdbce",
      "text": "the model asks for, feeds the",
      "hash": "10f5da56c965a256ca98a57efe819e1eddec1518566b36ae035f124d213287ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "b387dc791e8ff90a8d19701504179664dee9827c8d148336bc7269e34b583d5b",
      "text": "tool results",
      "hash": "a5594e12dfffd8e54c36d9b99bc31c7d41f0389d2251790338f34e836a3211fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3aa957843854b596efa59ddb572cb88039b4cc99fb66c6abe7c53d8dd124afa",
      "text": "back in, stores the",
      "hash": "139f9d9902611ed401f044dda4929f899cc2748bdb6eb878da3184732117716e"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b7fcb475b5975412c37d0c711901f5fb55dd273c8fb15440a98381963d8bad3",
      "text": "history, asks you for permission before risky actions, and decides when to",
      "hash": "81255f8b52df54a672d4ea1f60d1f7f413122732f7d943355217a62ccd91269b"
    },
    {
      "id": "add52ac089d8d20c2f570c7234c4d01cb12d5f8b574d798c16dba0dcb87f5885",
      "text": ". The agent loop — model proposes, harness executes, repeat — is run by the harness.",
      "hash": "4976a117495dc6f9dd68c6e4ecb6cf02496df47abdf2cfc168b5fac7710df5ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "0701203d39d82916dfcf6f693ce2b66e91086c8e9c868191a74d1e9709796be6",
      "text": "This matters for diagnosis. When behaviour differs between two products, or between yesterday and today, the model is often not the variable — the harness is. A different system prompt, a different set of tools, a changed permission default, or a new context-management strategy all change behaviour without any change to the model. It also means the harness is where most of your configuration lives:",
      "hash": "de68e9d53b1a55adf09a7ff46e72a93f8afabd580349ebd90f567845226d02b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "54683afa2b62aacd26d64cb0591cb170c1e6ce63767fd9576b9b0dcf078795a1",
      "text": "files, permission settings, and hooks are all instructions to the harness, not the model.",
      "hash": "c5a6affc1c3690d35e983baf494ed2833fb9a32d4c0e2686ab195f7358b54fd2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c596d71cfca89495a61a790759971e6d8f598c2703204f357a14de3ea7e0148c",
      "text": "Examples: Claude Code, Cursor, Codex CLI — and Claude.ai, which is a chat harness rather than a coding one.",
      "hash": "142f55f507971670feabbbb1379a7c5eeb5f9a072141fbc81b018385a0a26d15"
    },
    {
      "id": "a16ea30d0f67122beea91bcf8c316e8427d9c991eceeb97192197a9c7d7ebb0a",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "b43fb75b99cb4ae9c4e0bc14f1e4c8cd40ae5d54421872524fc0430e70341b99",
      "text": "\"Same model, why is Claude Code editing files and Claude.ai just answering questions?\"",
      "hash": "b3ac928204d90767b4ea86984d28804dc5655792aa30b3275a11ac62f6db772e"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a3d1195b64f660f30c8c4c31a4e1932c17deda213777d3970293024ae1869cb",
      "text": "\"Different harnesses — Claude Code has",
      "hash": "3415f8da357ef9940ea5f3912395f163ac7dda651a1014a3c77af7e24990f94f"
    },
    {
      "id": "53047e6855a536fc2d8931c3d8cb794c71d26f3e1f20a265b9334b415057e4c0",
      "text": "tools, a different system prompt, and a permission layer. The model isn't the variable here.\"",
      "hash": "7e3e5883ec45bfcb019e6481e251b3e2b4def45323517b517eaf82df2b9785fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "b98a5eaf5dbd7704429f7a6c9565edc2b6d29f7361bd390bc29ef6f9b29f096f",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d134d260d6d9a895eb4bee11c07ee62ab7f647d8013b943f78e2b7a3b6dd66f8",
      "text": "Model provider",
      "hash": "ea70384c465d5c89fb7cdd19647c540c4025a1c17532dcb8b987d7b753cf8596"
    },
    {
      "id": "87da198809c824cf5049303ce15d0240e01930f89176e2d185d01a5d4521c136",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "d94c14f2d06c560fe86773ab5ba550105c249678389bdef36c9ca5b6f62dfefb",
      "text": "Model provider request",
      "hash": "9c5ec7e007cdf80e19c7d748afcb27235638ab5cd45408bba18188a20fc2e611"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6a97f37dc0b0cd098eaeed735c8966d3815d657875b613b7aa93ff67dbcc390",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "77a4532e081f4e1f26405d85435e57c1ad6086c882dfd12f759381ca32acd5e1",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "603655f86f9535757d7047ef738592abd996dbbf08922c945b654b1bc43a8c19",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc73bcc6311d8e4aa1ad2b906ee54ab0bce351cc984d2a0ef365037b83ddf20",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab0a790cbe4ae8ef51e8a376add1a6685dd94d7f158918fe89d7dd5495ee545b",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e5cdf7755ef838e2418dfa1e6dcadf5de7957b0780b19424add622ad3a6c30e",
      "text": "No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.",
      "hash": "461f8758206b36fd4ddfaf6740b33dc0de41c9c7acb9121525993b781d5e18bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "72f526eca28b84f692404775326b2a054bfada1257acce890748b177feda1fb6",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
